The canonical guidance for this repository is the root `AGENTS.md`, reached through the shared hub
`docs/agents/ai-instructions.md`. Read both before making a change.

This is the specification repository, not the implementation. The source-of-truth rule is inverted
here: the specification binds implementations, and an implementation that disagrees is the bug —
with one dated exception that is live today and stated in `AGENTS.md`.

No scoped `AGENTS.md` files exist yet; the root file governs every edit.

Before editing any `*.md`, read `docs/agents/documentation-strategy.md`. Before editing anything
under `spec/`, read `docs/agents/spec-authoring.md` as well — requirement IDs are permanent and a
renumbering is a silent break.
